flowchart TD
    Input([Text Input]) --> ExtractURL[Extract URLs]
    Input --> ExtractEmail[Extract Emails]
    Input --> ExtractDomain[Extract Domains]
    Input --> SE[Social Engineering Regex]

    %% URL Processing
    ExtractURL --> CheckIP[Detect IP-Based URLs]
    ExtractURL --> CheckScheme[Detect Dangerous Schemes <br/> javascript: data:]
    ExtractURL --> CheckShort[Detect URL Shorteners]
    ExtractURL --> CheckTypo[Levenshtein Typosquatting]
    
    %% API Services
    ExtractURL --> GSB[Google Safe Browsing API]
    ExtractEmail --> HIBP[Have I Been Pwned API]
    ExtractDomain --> WHOIS[WHOIS Domain Age < 30 Days]

    %% Result aggregation
    CheckIP --> IntelResults{Threat Intel Results}
    CheckScheme --> IntelResults
    CheckShort --> IntelResults
    CheckTypo --> IntelResults
    SE --> IntelResults
    GSB --> IntelResults
    HIBP --> IntelResults
    WHOIS --> IntelResults

    IntelResults --> AttachToPrediction([Appended to Final Prediction JSON])
